2026-03-04  Zackary Parsons  <parsons.zackary@gmail.com>

	* Version 0.2.0
	* Parameter expansion: $var, ${var}, $?, $0-$9, $#, $@, $*
	* Arena allocator replacing malloc/free in core
	* Session loop rewritten as explicit FSM
	* POSIX compliance test harness (test/posix/)
	* Smoke tests moved to test/smoke/
	* GNU make build system with modern and portable profiles
	* License locked to GPLv3
